---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Trevor Price School of Motoring - Prices" description="Driving lessons at £37 per hour with no extra hidden charges.">
    <h1>Prices</h1>
    <p>Lessons currently cost £37 per hour with no extra hidden charges (Late cancellation fees may be charged when less than 48 hours notice is given). This price is the same for both standard lessons and Pass Plus</p>
    <p>Block booking are available on request when and where possible.</p>
    <p>There is no additional cost for the use of the vehicle during the driving test.</p>
</BaseLayout>
